{"@context":{"@language":"en-us","CIP100":"https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/blob/master/CIP-0100/README.md#","CIP119":"https://github.com/cardano-foundation/CIPs/blob/master/CIP-0119/README.md#","authors":{"@container":"@set","@context":{"name":"http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/name","witness":{"@context":{"publicKey":"CIP100:publicKey","signature":"CIP100:signature","witnessAlgorithm":"CIP100:witnessAlgorithm"},"@id":"CIP100:witness"}},"@id":"CIP100:authors"},"body":{"@context":{"abstract":"CIP119:abstract","doNotList":"CIP119:doNotList","givenName":"CIP119:givenName","image":"CIP119:image","motivations":"CIP119:motivations","objectives":"CIP119:objectives","paymentAddress":"CIP119:paymentAddress","qualifications":"CIP119:qualifications","references":{"@container":"@set","@context":{"GovernanceMetadata":"CIP100:GovernanceMetadataReference","Identity":"CIP119:IdentityReference","Link":"CIP119:LinkReference","Other":"CIP100:OtherReference","label":"CIP100:reference-label","referenceHash":{"@context":{"hashAlgorithm":"CIP100:hashAlgorithm","hashDigest":"CIP119:hashDigest"},"@id":"CIP119:referenceHash"},"uri":"CIP100:reference-uri"},"@id":"CIP119:references"}},"@id":"CIP119:body"},"hashAlgorithm":"CIP100:hashAlgorithm"},"authors":[],"body":{"abstract":"CHEF is the DRep run by the operator of the Cardano Chef Pool (CHEF) in Vancouver, Canada. I vote on every governance action and publish my reasoning in plain language, every time.","doNotList":false,"givenName":"CHEF","motivations":"I want to be a DRep because I see what's going on with the governance on Cardano right now and I believe that it's important for as many people as possible to participate and have a voice. Governance now decides where Cardano's treasury goes, and staking rewards require an active governance delegation. I vote on every proposal and explain each vote publicly.","objectives":"I believe in decentralization and in the power of community. I joined Cardano back in 2017, and up until now I still believe in that vision that Charles had back then, to use our technology to make other people's lives better.\nMy goals as a DRep are to give voice to those who have the same beliefs, and ensure that this voice is being heard. I keep delegation simple: one pool, one DRep, run by the same operator in Vancouver, Canada.","paymentAddress":"addr1qyvhwx5yecq28tga8yhj25pm8ccm375l7mzsft2upd406hqgeqtu940733076lafemlm9ulm0l685zc03l6vscttfzesgxd5x4","qualifications":"Cardano member since September 2017.\nStake Pool Operator\nGreek Cardano Ambassador\nBuilding real-world asset (RWA) solutions on Cardano\nOperator of the CHEF stake pool (active since epoch 293, about 712k ADA live stake, 1% margin, 1,106 lifetime blocks) and World Mobile EarthNode operator (ChefNode, Vancouver)","references":[{"@type":"Link","label":"X (Twitter)","uri":"https://x.com/CardanoChefPool"},{"@type":"Identity","label":"LinkedIn","uri":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/theodore-morisis"},{"@type":"Link","label":"Website","uri":"https://chefnode.io"},{"@type":"Link","label":"CHEF pool on Cexplorer","uri":"https://cexplorer.io/pool/pool1dqhaw0h2f4ehpdhh57quszcj22qhkglhg6yvaf39w3clxdl2kpy"}]},"hashAlgorithm":"blake2b-256"}
